 In general, the width of a product in the form in which it is presented or packaged for retail sale", "eng", ~U[2026-10-14 01:34:55.977565Z], ~U[2026-10-14 01:34:55.977565Z], "7a81cc3a-00df-4899-a5ef-cfc9e988818c", "7a100f43-af29-4d66-81c7-9607d57b5b7e", "Thickness", "For a book, the overall thickness of the spine. For a folded map, the thickness when folded. For packaged products, the depth of the retail packaging, and for trade-only products, the depth of the trade packaging. In general, the thickness or depth of a product in the form in which it is presented or packaged for retail sale", "eng", ~U[2026-10-14 01:34:55.977565Z], ~U[2026-10-14 01:34:55.977565Z], "48f07b1b-168f-4597-9b7a-c15cc47d2a14", "e46417fa-c156-4cd3-8829-44af3d040150", "Page trim height", "Overall height (code 01) is preferred for general use, as it includes the board overhang for hardbacks", "eng", ~U[2026-10-14 01:34:55.977565Z], ~U[2026-10-14 01:34:55.977565Z], "20c96fe0-8e11-4ee6-928d-900fea270302", "ff4e367e-00fc-4274-aa16-ac5240dcaff6", "Page trim width", "Overall width (code 02) is preferred for general use, as it includes the board overhang and spine thickness for hardbacks", "eng", ~U[2026-10-14 01:34:55.977565Z], ~U[2026-10-14 01:34:55.977565Z], "b4ed195e-0ed7-43bf-8b4a-b72c64d6a179", "67e6b8ea-4ded-489c-9a6b-161e0275bb55", "Unit volume", "The volume of the product, including any retail packaging. Note the <MeasureUnit> is interpreted as a volumetric unit – for example code cm = cubic centimetres (ie millilitres), and code oz = (US) fluid ounces. Only for use in ONIX 3.0 or later", "eng", ~U[2026-10-14 01:34:55.977565Z], ~U[2026-10-14 01:34:55.977565Z], "fc9a4e8e-563c-42a3-acda-9c70fb01eab4", "5ab09b55-31d4-4739-a1d4-df7f2f368ff4", "Unit capacity", "Volume of the internal (fluid) contents of a product (eg of paint in a can). Note the <MeasureUnit> is interpreted as a volumetric unit – for example code cm = cubic centimetres (ie millilitres), and code oz = (US) fluid ounces. Only for 